  "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on `55556716a5e42fb581a8dfea2a8bfc2aaf653451`.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/46027502982\n\nFailing steps:\n\n```\n     FAIL in 138s failed: tests/example_catalog.rs [tests: catalog_3d_rough_finish::rebuilds, catalog_3d_rough_finish::regenerates] slow: catalog_3d_rough_finish::rebuilds (>60s), catalog_3d_rough_finish::regenerates (>60s)\n```\n\nThe gate then reached the 75-minute step timeout (2026-11-27T16:59:21Z). The head `55556716a` is the merge of #4323. The same two tests failed on the run of `2ec2522` (run 46000461238, before this one). The suite is known to near its 60 s budget and fails under load (#3975). This issue closes itself on the next green run.\n\n<!-- post-merge-last-sha: f43e973b8a51703a3cbdd62311b40d136ade6753 -->",
